  "cells": [
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "# What Drives Student Math Performance? An Explainable ML Study\n",
        "\n",
        "**Question:** Which background and behavior factors help predict whether a student passes the final math course, and how far can we trust those predictions?\n",
        "\n",
        "**Data:** UCI Student Performance dataset (student-mat.csv), containing 395 students.\n",
        "\n",
        "**Target:** Pass (G3 >= 10) versus fail.\n",
        "\n",
        "**Features:** Background and behavioural variables, excluding prior grades (G1 and G2).\n",
        "\n",
        "**Models:** Logistic Regression and Random Forest, compared against a majority-class baseline.\n",
        "\n",
        "**Evaluation:** Stratified cross-validation, accuracy, balanced accuracy, ROC-AUC, failing-student recall, and Brier score with calibration plots.\n",
        "\n",
        "**Explainability:** Logistic Regression coefficients and permutation importance.\n",
        "\n",
        "**Sensitivity analysis:** Compared the primary analysis of 357 students with nonzero final grades against an analysis including all 395 students.\n"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "NwXmDgGunKWP"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "import numpy as np\n",
        "import pandas as pd\n",
        "import matplotlib.pyplot as plt\n",
        "import seaborn as sns\n",
        "\n",
        "from sklearn.model_selection import train_test_split, StratifiedKFold, cross_validate\n",
        "from sklearn.compose import ColumnTransformer\n",
        "from sklearn.preprocessing import OneHotEncoder, StandardScaler\n",
        "from sklearn.pipeline import Pipeline\n",
        "from sklearn.linear_model import LogisticRegression\n",
        "from sklearn.ensemble import RandomForestClassifier\n",
        "from sklearn.dummy import DummyClassifier\n",
        "from sklearn.inspection import permutation_importance\n",
        "from sklearn.metrics import (\n",
        "    accuracy_score, balanced_accuracy_score, roc_auc_score,\n",
        "    classification_report, confusion_matrix, ConfusionMatrixDisplay,\n",
        "    make_scorer, recall_score,\n",
        ")\n",
        "\n",
        "SEED = 42  # fixed seed so results are reproducible\n",
        "sns.set_theme(style=\"whitegrid\")"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "lAKyXYgBn6Yn"
      },
      "execution_count": 1,
      "outputs": []
    },
