    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "-gA2RmRVvE4s"
      },
      "source": [
        "**What this shows.** The sign of every top coefficient was the same in all 5 folds, but the 5 folds share about 80% of their students, so this shows consistency within this dataset and not that the effect exists in general.\n",
        "\n",
        "The most stable coefficient is `schoolsup_yes` (mean -1.19, std 0.07). `goout`, `famsup_yes`, `absences` and `failures` are also stable and negative. Others vary a lot between folds (for example `nursery_yes`, std 0.28 against a mean of -0.48), so they are less trustworthy. The top 10 also changed compared with the single split: `famsup` and `absences` entered and `higher` dropped out. Rankings from one split should not be over-interpreted."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "def perm_table(model, name):\n",
        "    r = permutation_importance(\n",
        "        model, X_test, y_test, scoring=\"roc_auc\", n_repeats=30, random_state=SEED\n",
        "    )\n",
        "    return pd.DataFrame({\n",
        "        \"feature\": X_test.columns,\n",
        "        f\"{name}_mean\": r.importances_mean,\n",
        "        f\"{name}_std\": r.importances_std,\n",
        "    }).set_index(\"feature\")\n",
        "\n",
        "importance = perm_table(lr_model, \"LR\").join(perm_table(rf_model, \"RF\"))\n",
        "\n",
        "top = (importance.assign(avg=importance[[\"LR_mean\", \"RF_mean\"]].mean(axis=1))\n",
        "                 .sort_values(\"avg\", ascending=False).head(8))\n",
        "\n",
        "fig, ax = plt.subplots(figsize=(8, 5))\n",
        "pos = np.arange(len(top))\n",
        "ax.barh(pos - 0.2, top[\"LR_mean\"], height=0.4, xerr=top[\"LR_std\"], label=\"Logistic Regression\")\n",
        "ax.barh(pos + 0.2, top[\"RF_mean\"], height=0.4, xerr=top[\"RF_std\"], label=\"Random Forest\")\n",
        "ax.set_yticks(pos)\n",
        "ax.set_yticklabels(top.index)\n",
        "ax.invert_yaxis()\n",
        "ax.set_xlabel(\"Drop in ROC-AUC when feature is shuffled\")\n",
        "ax.set_title(\"Permutation importance (test set, 30 repeats)\")\n",
        "ax.legend()\n",
        "plt.tight_layout()\n",
        "plt.savefig(\"importance.png\", dpi=150, bbox_inches=\"tight\")  # image for the README\n",
        "plt.show()"
      ],
